{"vocab":{"version":1,"updated":"2026-10-21","about":"The Daily tag vocabulary (James, 21 Oct 2026). Every Daily row in Filo's Factory carries 1 value for each dimension below, written to the Notion property named in `property`. The pulse sets them when it writes a row; the enrich step fills any that are still empty; sb-dash's Recipe tab counts them and compares each value's approval and send numbers. A dimension with a `knob` can be steered from the Recipe tab: the knob settings live in context/daily-recipe.json and automation/daily_recipe.py turns them into the brief the pulse follows each run. To add a dimension: add it here, add its Notion property (a select, or multi_select for an open list), and the tab, the pipeline and the tests pick it up. Never rename a value that rows already carry: add the new one and retag.","dimensions":[{"id":"focus","label":"Focus","property":"Focus (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Is the point about 1 company, a group of companies, or a whole economy?","values":[{"name":"Company","def":"About 1 company: its numbers, its move, its product. Netflix's margin, Domino's store count."},{"name":"Industry","def":"About a market, a category or a group of companies compared: AI chatbot share, the biggest banks, the Mag 7."},{"name":"Economy","def":"About a whole economy or society: GDP, jobs, trade, prices, construction, how people earn and spend."}],"knob":{"type":"balance","left":{"label":"Company","values":["Company"]},"right":{"label":"Big picture","values":["Industry","Economy"]}}},{"id":"freshness","label":"Freshness","property":"Freshness (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Does the point rest on something from the last 6 months?","values":[{"name":"Recent","def":"The point rests on news or a data point from the last 6 months, so it would read as old news in a year: a quarter's results, a launch, this year's survey."},{"name":"Evergreen","def":"The point is structural and still lands in a year: a long trend, how a business model works, a ranking that moves slowly."}],"knob":{"type":"balance","left":{"label":"Recent","values":["Recent"]},"right":{"label":"Evergreen","values":["Evergreen"]}}},{"id":"ai","label":"AI","property":"AI (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Is AI the story?","values":[{"name":"AI","def":"AI is the story: AI companies and models, self-driving, AI spend and adoption, and the chips, power and data centres built for AI (an Nvidia or TSMC story counts when AI demand is what moves the number)."},{"name":"Not AI","def":"AI is absent, or a side note to a story about something else."}],"knob":{"type":"balance","left":{"label":"AI","values":["AI"]},"right":{"label":"Not AI","values":["Not AI"]}}},{"id":"tone","label":"Tone","property":"Tone (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Is it good news or bad news for the people in it?","values":[{"name":"Optimist","def":"Good news for the people in it: growth, a win, a clever move, something getting cheaper or better."},{"name":"Neutral","def":"Neither: a ranking, a structure, how something works, a fact that is not a win or a loss for anyone in particular."},{"name":"Doomer","def":"Bad news is the whole point: a decline, job losses, a collapse, a dunk on a company or its people (Tom, 16 Oct 2026: go light on these)."}],"knob":{"type":"balance","left":{"label":"Doomer","values":["Doomer"]},"right":{"label":"Optimist","values":["Optimist"]},"neutral":["Neutral"]}},{"id":"chartType","label":"Chart type","property":"Chart Type (Daily)","type":"select","question":"What shape is the chart?","values":[{"name":"Bar","def":"Bars or columns: a ranking, a comparison, a dominant bar."},{"name":"Line","def":"A line over time: a spike, a cliff, a crossover, a widening gap."},{"name":"Waffle","def":"A grid of squares: a share of a whole you can count."},{"name":"Map","def":"A map: where something is."},{"name":"Scatter Plot","def":"Points on 2 axes: how 2 measures relate."},{"name":"Waterfall","def":"A waterfall: how a total is built up or broken down."},{"name":"Tree","def":"A treemap or hierarchy: parts of a whole by size."},{"name":"Flow Chart","def":"A flow: how money or things move between parties."},{"name":"Mixed","def":"More than 1 chart type in the graphic."}],"knob":{"type":"weights"}},{"id":"region","label":"Region","property":"Region (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Where is the story set?","values":[{"name":"US","def":"The United States, or a US company whose numbers are mostly American."},{"name":"Europe","def":"Europe, the UK included, or a European company."},{"name":"China","def":"China, or a Chinese company."},{"name":"India","def":"India, or an Indian company."},{"name":"Asia-Pacific","def":"Anywhere else in Asia or Oceania: Japan, Korea, Taiwan, Southeast Asia, Australia."},{"name":"Latin America","def":"Mexico, Central and South America."},{"name":"Middle East & Africa","def":"The Middle East and Africa."},{"name":"Global","def":"Worldwide, several regions compared, or a global company whose story is not about 1 place (Nvidia's share of all AI compute)."}],"knob":{"type":"weights"}},{"id":"sector","label":"Sector","property":"Sector (Daily)","type":"select","question":"Which part of the economy is it about?","values":[{"name":"Software & Internet","def":"Software, apps, platforms, AI models and labs, social media, search."},{"name":"Chips & Hardware","def":"Semiconductors, chip equipment, devices, servers, AI compute."},{"name":"Finance & Markets","def":"Banks, investing, stock markets, valuations, IPOs, payments, crypto."},{"name":"Consumer & Retail","def":"Shops, brands, food and drink, e-commerce, what people buy."},{"name":"Media & Entertainment","def":"Streaming, games, music, podcasts, sport, publishing."},{"name":"Transport & Travel","def":"Airlines, cars, EVs, ride-hailing, logistics, tourism."},{"name":"Energy & Infrastructure","def":"Power, grids, oil and gas, data centre build-outs, construction."},{"name":"Industry & Manufacturing","def":"Factories, industrial production, machinery, materials."},{"name":"Space & Defence","def":"Rockets, satellites, defence."},{"name":"Health","def":"Healthcare, pharma, biotech, wellbeing."},{"name":"Work & Jobs","def":"Employment, wages, hiring, how people work."},{"name":"Trade & Policy","def":"Trade flows, tariffs, regulation, government spending, geopolitics."},{"name":"Property","def":"Housing, real estate, offices."}],"knob":{"type":"weights"}},{"id":"themes","label":"Themes","property":"Themes (Daily)","type":"multi_select","open":true,"max":2,"question":"Which business ideas does it show? Up to 3.","hint":"An open list for filtering later: reuse an existing option before adding one, 1 to 3 words each, title case (Pricing, Market Share, Unit Economics, Concentration, Subscriptions, Ads, Platform Shift, Franchising).","values":[],"knob":null},{"id":"origin","label":"Came from","property":"Origin (Daily)","type":"select","question":"How did the idea reach Filo's Factory?","values":[{"name":"Pulse","def":"The daily pulse found it on its own (the only route the knobs steer)."},{"name":"Inspo","def":"Someone dropped it in #daily-inspo."},{"name":"By hand","def":"Typed in or given as a kernel by a person, a backfill, or anything else."}],"knob":null}]},"recipe":{"version":2,"savedAt":"2026-10-22T09:56:42.326Z","savedBy":"James","note":"initial pass with tom","windowDays":14,"knobs":{"focus":{"steer":true,"left":65},"freshness":{"steer":false,"left":40},"ai":{"steer":true,"left":30},"tone":{"steer":true,"left":5},"chartType":{"steer":false,"weights":{"Bar":2,"Line":2,"Waffle":2,"Map":2,"Scatter Plot":2,"Waterfall":2,"Tree":2,"Flow Chart":2,"Mixed":2}},"region":{"steer":false,"weights":{"US":4,"Europe":1,"China":1,"India":1,"Asia-Pacific":1,"Latin America":1,"Middle East & Africa":1,"Global":2}},"sector":{"steer":false,"weights":{"Software & Internet":4,"Chips & Hardware":1,"Finance & Markets":1,"Consumer & Retail":3,"Media & Entertainment":3,"Transport & Travel":2,"Energy & Infrastructure":1,"Industry 